SUMMARY:Say No to AI Data Centres Virtual Town Hall - by ClimateFast
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/say-no-to-ai-data-centres-virtual-town-hall-t
 ickets-1996766958725\n\nHosted by ClimateFast
  (https://climatefast.ca)\n\nConcerned about AI data centre development in
  Ontario? Join ClimateFast's virtual townhall meeting. There are currently
  over 6\,500+ mega-watts of electricity connections being requested for
  data centres in Ontario\, most of which are for artificial intelligence
  (AI) data centres. It's time get organized and get involved in our
  community.
END:VEVENT
