SUMMARY:August 13 Rally to Tell Crosslinx: Hold Dexterra Accountable - by
  SEIU Local 2
LOCATION:90 Eglinton Ave E.
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://m.facebook.com/events/916983637512938/\n\nHosted by SEIU Local 2
  (https://seiulocal2.ca)\n\nDexterra Group hid contracts and kept workers
  from being part of the City-Wide Toronto collective agreement to clean
  the Eglinton Crosstown LRT stations\, and sub-contracted work which led
  to lower wages and worse working conditions for workers. Join SEIU to
  send Crosslinx a powerful and united message: Hold Dexterra Accountable!
END:VEVENT
