SUMMARY:Copy: Publishing and Political Movements - by The Vermin
LOCATION:Net Plaza Print Shop
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/copy-publishing-and-political-movements-tick
 ets-1992427213430\n\nHosted by The Vermin (https://thevermin.ca/)\n\nThe
  Vermin is partnering with Writers Against the War on Gaza Toronto and
  Colour Code for a workshop on publishing and political movements as part
  of Zine Dream\, an annual small press art fair in Toronto. Learn how to
  make your own publication and how to publish in lockstep with political
  struggle. 
