SUMMARY:Civic Meetup #556: Lessons Learned from a Cyber Attack: Toronto
  Public Library’s Experience - by Civic Tech Toronto
LOCATION:available upon registration
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-556-lessons-ctlgvm\n\nHosted by
  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nIn 2023\, Toronto Public
  Library shut down every network and computer system wide after
  discovering a cyberattack\, meanwhile all 100 branches remained open
  anyway. This session walks through the incident response governance\, the
  phased restoration of a 5\,000+ computer environment\, and the lessons
  TPL learned the hard way.
END:VEVENT
